# Another share example
# You can use different security flavors per export if needed, but krb5p is preferred.

/export/share2   *(rw,sec=krb5p,no_root_squash,sync,hide)

# Example with a specific client (still using user Kerberos tickets):
# /export/share2   client1.example.com(rw,sec=krb5p,no_root_squash,sync)
